{title: Phir Miloge Kabhi}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Asha Bhosle O P Nayyar}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D]Phir mi [A]loge kabhi is,        [D]baat ka vaada karalo
[D]Hamase ek aur mulaa [A]kaat,        kaa vaa [G]daa kar [D]alo
[D]Dil ki har baat,        [D]adhuri hai adhuri hai abhi
Apani ek [G]aur mulaa [A]kaat,        zaru [D]ri hai abhi
Chand lam [A]ho ke liye,        sa [D]ath ka vaada karalo
[D]Hamase ek aur mulaa [A]kaat,        kaa vaa [G]daa kara [D]lo
[D]Aap kyun dil ka hasi raaz,        mujhe [A]dete hai
Kyun naya [D]nagama naya saaz,        mujhe [A]dete hain
Mai to hun [D]dubi hui,        [D]pyaar ki tufaano me
Aap saa [A]hil se hi,        [D]aavaaz mujhe [A]dete hai [D]
[D]Kal bhi [A]hoge yahi,        jaza [D]baat ye vaadaa karalo
[D]Hamase ek aur mulaa [A]kaat,        kaa vaa [G]daa kara [D]lo
